==Battleground==
*1 [[Prisoner Cat (Enemy)|Prisoner Cat]] spawns after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Kite Cat (Enemy)|Kite Cat]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gato Amigo (Enemy)|Gato Amigos]] spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Riceball Cat (Enemy)|Riceball Cats]] spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Hyper Mr. (Enemy)|Hyper Mr.]] spawns after 126.67 seconds<sup>3,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Dancer Cat (Enemy)|Dancer Cat]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
Treat this stage like you would the original [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 20|Floor 20]], except with Kite and Prisoner Cats showing up, and the lack of [[Unicycle Cat (Enemy)|Unicycle Cat]]. Bringing decent ranged units, [[:Category:Anti-Traitless Cats|Anti-Traitless]] Cats, and maybe a rusher or two like [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] can help deal with Kite and Prisoner.

